<title>USA: Washington Energy Q4 oper shr loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Washington Energy Q4 oper shr loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr loss	     $0.18     loss	 $1.39</p>
<p> Oper net loss	     4,294     loss	33,430</p>
<p> Revs			 58,416		   50,981</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   24,235		   24,026</p>
<p>			12   MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr profit	   $1.03     loss	 $0.61</p>
<p> Oper net profit	  24,960     loss	14,465</p>
<p> Revs			425,711		  443,611</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   24,159		   23,893</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Fiscal 1996 net including discontinued operations were $23.1 million, or $0.96 per share, vs a net loss of $41.1 million or $1.72 per share in the prior year. Net for the fourth quarter was a loss of $5.1 million or $0.21 per share, vs year-ago loss of $59.9 million or $2.49 per share.</p>
